Adds a "Unbound Overview" widget to the OPNsense dashboard, mirroring
the key data from Services -> Unbound DNS -> Query Log: total/resolved/
blocked counters, blocklist size, a rolling query chart and the top-N
passed or blocked domains.

The widget only reuses the existing /api/unbound/overview/* endpoints,
so no backend changes are required and it is offered in the dashboard
picker to any user with access to Services -> Unbound DNS -> Query Log.

